      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早晨的海风现在才总算吹过了陆地。\n……是从训练员的方向吹来的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b802fbe055126b51d2cdd8ec142b0f1eb19db577a08dc8c902ac85041953184",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
