    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f5e009767df9c32972335a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早上的海风是经过了傍晚无风的平静后才变成陆风的。\n所以我们只要在这里等它，一定能等到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dbde9b491c8bd16f8c55ffb5c37997224fadcb52798e70681b5f0cca6a4e7fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1078/storytimeline_041078007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bd44b9cbc797493f16482a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早上从海上吹到陆地的风，到了夜晚便会从陆地吹回海上。\n所以很快就能再次遇到早上感受到的风……她似乎是这个意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24193747ee1d9b5ad3d1ed16cb05ed4ba940f16105aa9beca3f288edc03236c6",
